{"type":"message","id":"ba7df227","parentId":"811d58c9","timestamp":"2026-06-12T01:24:40.591Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_P6VCu69yIPLRvgnQX3Y01991","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \"position_size_pct\": 0.20,     # 单仓 20% - 2026-03-28 老公指示\n    \"max_positions\": 4,\n\n    # 开仓阈值（按市场状态分层）\n    \"score_threshold\": {\n        \"trending\":  70,\n        \"ranging\":   55,  # 震荡市要求更高确认度，避免假突破\n        \"volatile\":  90,\n        # 单币阈值加成：等于提高开仓门槛\n        \"per_symbol_bonus\": {\n            \"SOL\": 10,           # SOL 历史胜率低，多要10分\n        },\n    },\n\n    # 基础止盈止损（ATR动态覆盖）\n    \"base_tp_pct\":  0.08,\n    \"base_sl_pct\":  0.05,\n\n    # 移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（回撤比例）\n    # 2026-06-06 老公指示：改为相对止盈比例（ATR 动态止盈联动）\n    \"trailing_tiers\": [\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.50, \"gap_ratio\": 0.20},   # 达到50%止盈时,回撤=止盈×20%\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 0.75, \"gap_ratio\": 0.25},   # 达到75%止盈时,回撤=止盈×25%\n        {\"pnl_ratio\": 1.00, \"gap\": 0.999},        # 达到止盈,全平\n    ],\n\n    # ATR止损倍数分层\n    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n        (0.04, 1.5),   # ATR% < 4%  →  止损1.5倍ATR\n\n[2765 more lines in file. Use offset=98 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781227480582}}
{"type":"message","id":"d928e8e4","parentId":"ba7df227","timestamp":"2026-06-12T01:24:46.736Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the current thresholds:\n- trending: 70\n- ranging: 55\n- volatile: 90\n- SOL per_symbol_bonus: +10\n\nThe user wants to raise the threshold. Since the market is in ranging mode mostly, raising the ranging threshold from 55 to something higher would be the key change.\n\nLet me propose raising:\n- ranging: 55 → 65 (harder to open in choppy market)\n- trending: 70 → 75 (slightly harder)\n- maybe increase per_symbol_bonus for more coins\n\nActually, the user said \"不用等他跑吧\" - meaning don't wait, just do it. Let me go ahead and raise the thresholds.\n\nI think raising ranging from 55 to 65 is a good move. This means only stronger signals trigger in ranging markets. That's the main issue - too many borderline signals (55-65 range) were triggering and then getting stopped out.\n\nLet me also consider if we should give per-symbol bonuses to DOT and ETH since they've been losing.\n\nActually let me just do the main change: raise ranging threshold from 55 to 65. Keep it simple.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，直接提门槛。现在震荡市阈值是 55 分，太低，很多边缘信号冲进来然后止损。提到 65。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_vufXlHVQ9DXqcnMWHQjo5350","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"        \"ranging\":   55,  # 震荡市要求更高确认度，避免假突破","new_string":"        \"ranging\":   65,  # 震荡市要求更高确认度，避免假突破（6/12 提至65防连续止损）"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":480,"output":657,"cacheRead":33792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34929,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781227480593}}
