{"type":"message","id":"1942edc4","parentId":"62c0c6a9","timestamp":"2026-06-12T09:17:03.094Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the ETH situation:\n\n1. Current position from query:\n   - ETH LONG, entry 1685, current 1676, PnL -0.07 USDT (-0.53%)\n   - TP: 1753, SL: 1652\n\n2. But wait, the log shows something concerning at 17:00:26:\n   `⚠️ ETH 交易所数量(0.0)与本地缓存(0.1)不一致，偏差 93.3%，可能是历史 bug 残留仓位`\n\nThis suggests the exchange shows 0 ETH quantity but local cache shows 0.1. That's a critical discrepancy - it means the position might actually be closed on Binance but the monitor still thinks it's open.\n\nBut the position query from the API returned ETH as a position. Let me look more carefully.\n\nThe position query output shows:\n- ETH LONG, entry 1685, amount shows 0.119, current 1676\n\nWait, the entry price is 1685 and amount is 0.119? That's about 0.119 ETH. At 1685 USDT/ETH, that's ~200 USDT notional. But the PnL is only -0.07 USDT which seems too small. Let me calculate: (1676-1685) * 0.119 = -1.07 USDT. But it shows -0.07 USDT. That doesn't add up.\n\nActually wait, re-reading:\n- PnL: -0.07 USDT (-0.53%)\n- Entry: 1685, Current: 1676\n- Price difference: -9 USDT\n- If PnL is -0.07, then position size would be: 0.07/9 = 0.0078 ETH. But the log shows amount=0.119.\n\nThat's very inconsistent. The position size from API might be different from what the display shows. Or the PnL is calculated differently.\n\nThe key issue the user is pointing out is the warning: \"ETH 交易所数量(0.0)与本地缓存(0.1)不一致\". This means the exchange says there's 0 ETH in position but local cache says 0.1. This is a ghost position - the position was already closed but the monitor thinks it's still open.\n\nLet me look at what happened:\n- ETH was opened on 06-12 02:59 \n- At 17:00, the system detected exchange quantity 0 vs local cache 0.1\n\nSo ETH was likely stop-lossed or closed but the monitor didn't register the close properly. This could be related to the API timeout issues earlier.\n\nBut the position query still shows ETH as an open position. Let me check if the query uses API or local cache.\n\nActually, the query output says \"从 Binance API 获取 3 个持仓\" so it's from the API. But the monitor log says exchange has 0. This is contradictory.\n\nLet me run a more detailed check on ETH specifically.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ETH 有问题。日志里有个关键告警：\n\n> 17:00:26 ⚠️ ETH 交易所数量(0.0)与本地缓存(0.1)不一致，偏差 93.3%\n\n交易所实际持仓量是 0，但本地缓存以为还有。这是幽灵仓位——ETH 很可能已经止损平掉了但 monitor 没抓到。让我用 API 直接看下 Binance 那边的真实情况。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_yWEr8PNr1KLdqIhP90pB5726","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, hashlib, hmac, time, urllib.request, ssl\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\nctx.check_hostname = False\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    c = json.load(f)\napi_key = c['binance_api']['api_key']\nsecret = c['binance_api']['secret_key']\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\n\nts = int(time.time()*1000)\nqs = f'timestamp={ts}'\nsig = hmac.new(secret.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{base}/fapi/v1/positionRisk?symbol=ETHUSDT&{qs}&signature={sig}'\n\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key})\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx)\ndata = json.loads(resp.read())\nfor p in data:\n    print(f'Symbol: {p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}, PosAmt: {p[\\\"positionAmt\\\"]}, Entry: {p[\\\"entryPrice\\\"]}, UPNL: {p[\\\"unRealizedProfit\\\"]}, Leverage: {p[\\\"leverage\\\"]}')\nif not data:\n    print('No position data returned')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_TzGTRr5c00QWEOob5a2z9380","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -E 'ETH.*(SL|TP|平仓|止损|止盈|close|成交|已实现)' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>&1 | grep '2026-06-12' | head -20","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1693,"output":1849,"cacheRead":36096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39638,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781255800807}}
