{"type":"message","id":"d6be8861","parentId":"26828f4a","timestamp":"2026-06-12T09:20:31.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both orders returned status=NEW but executedQty=0.000. This means they were placed but need to be filled. Let me wait a moment and check if they filled. Market orders should fill immediately on a liquid market.\n\nWait, the second order (BUY 0.020) was actually the one that could close the position. The first SELL 0.020 would have closed the 0.008 long and created a 0.012 short. The second BUY 0.020 would close that 0.012 short and create a 0.008 long. So we'd end up with 0.008 long again!\n\nI messed up. The correct sequence should be:\n1. SELL 0.020: closes 0.008 long, creates 0.012 short\n2. BUY 0.012: closes 0.012 short, net 0\n\nBut instead I did BUY 0.020 which would create a 0.008 long again. Let me just check the current position status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_zMxCl96YadKlFWnI3LHl6433","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sleep 3 && python3 -c \"\nimport json, hashlib, hmac, time, urllib.request, ssl\n\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\nctx.check_hostname = False\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    c = json.load(f)\napi_key = c['binance_api']['api_key']\nsecret = c['binance_api']['secret_key']\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\n\nts = int(time.time()*1000)\nqs = f'timestamp={ts}'\nsig = hmac.new(secret.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{base}/fapi/v2/positionRisk?{qs}&signature={sig}'\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key})\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx)\ndata = json.loads(resp.read())\nfor p in data:\n    if float(p['positionAmt']) != 0:\n        print(f\\\"{p['symbol']}: 数量={p['positionAmt']}, 入场={p['entryPrice']}, 浮盈={p['unRealizedProfit']}\\\")\nhas_eth = any(float(p['positionAmt']) != 0 and p['symbol'] == 'ETHUSDT' for p in data)\nprint(f'ETH 持仓状态: {\\\"还在\\\" if has_eth else \\\"已清空 ✅\\\"}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":187,"output":842,"cacheRead":49152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50181,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781256022155}}
