{"type":"message","id":"a279f71e","parentId":"52d4b11b","timestamp":"2026-06-12T09:20:48.506Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both market orders were placed but didn't fill. The ETH position is still 0.008. The entry price changed slightly from 1684.68 to 1677.75, suggesting the BUY order may have partially filled (adding 0.020 to the position, averaging down), but somehow the position is still 0.008.\n\nActually wait - the position is still 0.008 ETH. That means:\n- SELL 0.020 was placed (status=NEW, qty=0.000) but didn't execute - it might have been rejected silently or expired\n- BUY 0.020 was placed but also didn't execute\n\nNeither order actually filled. Market orders on Binance testnet should fill immediately if there's liquidity, but maybe they didn't go through because of the MIN_NOTIONAL issue or another validation error.\n\nLet me check the order status to see what happened.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_0COM3c1XPxkgf5EtS6f21019","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json, hashlib, hmac, time, urllib.request, ssl, urllib.parse\n\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\nctx.check_hostname = False\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    c = json.load(f)\napi_key = c['binance_api']['api_key']\nsecret = c['binance_api']['secret_key']\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\n\n# Check all open orders\nts = int(time.time()*1000)\nparams = {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT', 'timestamp': ts}\nqs = urllib.parse.urlencode(params)\nsig = hmac.new(secret.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{base}/fapi/v1/openOrders?{qs}&signature={sig}'\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key})\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx)\norders = json.loads(resp.read())\nif orders:\n    for o in orders:\n        print(f'Order: {o[\\\"orderId\\\"]} {o[\\\"side\\\"]} {o[\\\"type\\\"]} qty={o[\\\"origQty\\\"]} exec={o[\\\"executedQty\\\"]} status={o[\\\"status\\\"]}')\nelse:\n    print('无挂单')\n\n# Check recent orders\nparams['limit'] = '5'\nqs = urllib.parse.urlencode(params)\nsig = hmac.new(secret.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{base}/fapi/v1/allOrders?{qs}&signature={sig}'\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key})\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx)\norders = json.loads(resp.read())\nprint('\\\\n最近订单:')\nfor o in orders[-5:]:\n    print(f'  {o[\\\"side\\\"]} {o[\\\"type\\\"]} qty={o[\\\"origQty\\\"]} exec={o[\\\"executedQty\\\"]} status={o[\\\"status\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":150,"output":949,"cacheRead":49920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781256036674}}
